msgstr "Platinum Partner"

#: ../../chip_adaptation_guide/edge/06_distribution_validation/compatibility_declaration.md:1
msgid "The chip is fully supported in the distribution."
msgstr "该芯片在发行版中完全受支持"

#: ../../chip_adaptation_guide/edge/06_distribution_validation/compatibility_declaration.md:1
msgid "Passes Level 1 + Level 2 + Level 3 validation and is an advanced partner."
